config MADULA_WS2812_LAYER_NUMBER
    bool "Blink the highest active layer number on Madula's shared SPI LED"
    depends on SHIELD_MADULA_CENTRAL
    depends on RGBLED_WIDGET && RGBLED_WIDGET_WS2812
    depends on ZMK_SPLIT_ROLE_CENTRAL
    help
      Use the widget's priority/sharing API; never override a higher-priority
      battery or connectivity indication. Layer 0 has no pulse. Other layers
      blink their numeric index, then return the LED to its previous state.

